# Production build values. Committed on purpose — nothing here is secret.
#
# Vite reads this file for `npm run build` only; `npm run dev` never sees it.
# It exists so the one setting that decides whether the site actually takes
# orders cannot be forgotten on a deploy.

# Points the order form at the PHP endpoint in server/api/, served from the
# same origin. Leaving this blank is what puts orderService.ts into mock mode,
# where a customer sees "order received" and nothing is ever sent.
VITE_ORDER_ENDPOINT=/api/order
